WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.666 --> 00:00:06.333
With Ash’s goal of entering the Kalos League driving him on,

2
00:00:06.399 --> 00:00:12.266
our heroes are headed to Shalour City, site of Ash’s third Kalos Gym battle.

3
00:00:14.066 --> 00:00:16.533
- Amazing!
- Pikachu.

4
00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:18.700
This is the famous Kalos Canyon.

5
00:00:18.766 --> 00:00:22.966
- Wow. What a sight.
- Sure is. What do you think, Dedenne?

6
00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.200
Na-na-na!

7
00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:27.200
- It’s magnificent to look at.
- Yeah.

8
00:00:27.266 --> 00:00:31.966
It took nature tens of thousands of years to create this masterpiece.

9
00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:35.033
- Why don’t we take a break here?
- Good idea.

10
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.233
Everybody come on out.

11
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.466
- Froakie!
- Fletch! Fletch! Ling!

12
00:00:44.066 --> 00:00:46.000
- Cha!
- Fletch! Fletch! Fletch!

13
00:00:46.066 --> 00:00:49.500
Oh, you haven’t met Hawlucha yet, have you, Fletchling?

14
00:00:49.566 --> 00:00:52.599
That’s right. My Pokémon need to meet it, too.

15
00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:53.966
Yeah. Mine, too.

16
00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:58.333
- Bun!
- Chespin!

17
00:00:59.566 --> 00:01:00.900
Fenn!

18
00:01:00.966 --> 00:01:05.366
This is our new friend. Meet Hawlucha. Let’s make it feel at home.

19
00:01:05.433 --> 00:01:06.899
Hawlucha!

20
00:01:09.766 --> 00:01:13.333
- This is Fennekin. Say hi.
- Fennekin.

21
00:01:13.399 --> 00:01:16.433
- You say hi, too, Dedenne.
- Na-na.

22
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.100
Lucha!

23
00:01:19.166 --> 00:01:20.633
Huh?

24
00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.033
- Che! Chespin! Che!
- Hawlu?

25
00:01:26.566 --> 00:01:28.200
Whoa, what was that?

26
00:01:30.766 --> 00:01:32.633
Huh. Here’s what it says.

27
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.433
Kalos Canyon is famous for its Sky Trainers.

28
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.433
Maybe that’s who they are.

29
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:42.933
- Wow, Sky Trainers.
- Pika, Pika.

30
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.833
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

31
00:01:45.899 --> 00:01:49.399
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

32
00:01:49.466 --> 00:01:52.166
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

33
00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:55.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

34
00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

35
00:01:58.366 --> 00:02:01.566
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

36
00:02:01.633 --> 00:02:05.000
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

37
00:02:05.066 --> 00:02:07.433
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

38
00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.933
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

39
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.000
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

40
00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:33.666
Talonflame, use Steel Wing.

41
00:02:33.733 --> 00:02:37.600
Talonflame!

42
00:02:37.666 --> 00:02:43.866
Use Fire Blast.

43
00:02:45.299 --> 00:02:47.533
They’re having a Pokémon battle in mid-air.

44
00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.733
That looks like fun.

45
00:02:49.799 --> 00:02:55.166
- Skarmory, use Fury Attack.
- Ska! Skarmoy!

46
00:02:55.233 --> 00:03:02.066
Dodge and use Fire Blast.

47
00:03:06.633 --> 00:03:10.966
- That’s awesome. I want to try that, too.
- Pika, Pika.

48
00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:14.233
- Excuse me. This is your first time here?
- Yup.

49
00:03:14.299 --> 00:03:16.666
They’re Sky Trainers, aren’t they?

50
00:03:16.733 --> 00:03:20.500
Absolutely correct. They were in the middle of their Sky Battle.

51
00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:24.033
That sounds great. So what do you have to do to be in one?

52
00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:28.200
- Well, you’ll need to learn how to fly.
- Hey, let’s give it a shot.

53
00:03:28.266 --> 00:03:31.533
- Pika. Pikachu!
- First off, you'll need to practice.

54
00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:35.733
-Our practice facility’s over there.

55
00:03:38.966 --> 00:03:42.100
Now, this is what you’ll wear.

56
00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:44.866
Just like what those Sky Trainers were wearing.

57
00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:48.066
- It’s called a wing suit.
- These are the coolest.

58
00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:51.966
- Great. This one’s just my size!
- And this is made for me.

59
00:03:52.033 --> 00:03:54.266
Um, um...

60
00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:58.066
- Where’s my suit?
- Well, I’m sorry.

61
00:03:58.133 --> 00:04:01.333
- You’re a bit too small to participate.
- Huh?

62
00:04:01.399 --> 00:04:05.733
If you’re small, the wings also become small so it’s dangerous.

63
00:04:05.799 --> 00:04:07.833
-You see, you’d need to be at least

64
00:04:07.899 --> 00:04:09.833
this tall in order to be a part of it.

65
00:04:09.899 --> 00:04:13.433
Come on. I want to do it! I want to do it!

66
00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.766
But, Bonnie, rules are there for a reason.

67
00:04:16.833 --> 00:04:17.833
Hm!

68
00:04:17.899 --> 00:04:21.366
Don’t worry. I’ll sit with you and we can watch it together.

69
00:04:21.433 --> 00:04:23.800
It’s okay. You go have fun.

70
00:04:23.866 --> 00:04:27.033
Dedenne’s going to be my watching buddy.

71
00:04:27.099 --> 00:04:29.233
Che, Chespin, Che!

72
00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.366
- And Chespin, too.
- Pin! Pin!

73
00:04:36.933 --> 00:04:40.366
Ha!

74
00:04:40.433 --> 00:04:45.500
Be wary. There’s a strong updraft that’s always blowing through Kalos Canyon.

75
00:04:45.566 --> 00:04:50.766
It’s important to keep that in mind. Now, this device simulates it.

76
00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:53.033
The wind will be blowing from below.

77
00:04:53.099 --> 00:04:56.133
- So try jumping into the wind to fly.
- Right.

78
00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:00.599
Oh. They all treat me like a little kid, but I’ve gotten really big.

79
00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:02.833
- Na-na-na!
- Pin! Pin! Cha!

80
00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.200
Pika! Pikachu!

81
00:05:04.266 --> 00:05:07.633
All right. Allow me to demonstrate.

82
00:05:11.599 --> 00:05:15.033
You see, you fly by catching the wind with your wings.

83
00:05:15.099 --> 00:05:17.533
I want to go first.

84
00:05:17.599 --> 00:05:20.633
Whoa! I’m flying!

85
00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.833
- You’re doing great!
- Me next.

86
00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.066
Now it’s my turn. Go!

87
00:05:26.133 --> 00:05:28.733
I’m flying!

88
00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.633
I’m flying, too! Whoa!

89
00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:34.500
Whoa! Maybe not.

90
00:05:34.566 --> 00:05:37.233
Whoa. That must’ve hurt.

91
00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:40.300
You know, this is harder than I thought.

92
00:05:40.366 --> 00:05:41.733
- Argh!
- Huh?

93
00:05:43.633 --> 00:05:46.733
- You’ll get the hang of it in no time.
- He’s right.

94
00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:50.900
Do you think it would it be okay if I tried flying with my Pokémon?

95
00:05:50.966 --> 00:05:54.300
You can’t have a Sky Battle unless you can fly with your Pokémon, right?

96
00:05:54.366 --> 00:05:55.833
That’s right.

97
00:05:57.466 --> 00:06:00.633
Fletchling. Fletchling.

98
00:06:01.633 --> 00:06:03.133
Haw!

99
00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.400
Fletchling and Hawlucha, you’re doing great. Now!

100
00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:09.599
- Ah!
- This is so fun!

101
00:06:09.666 --> 00:06:12.966
I’m up! Whoa! Oh!

102
00:06:16.833 --> 00:06:19.000
That’s my brother!

103
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.766
Hi there. Excuse me. Would you like to have a Sky Battle?

104
00:06:23.833 --> 00:06:25.766
- Me?
- Moria.

105
00:06:27.266 --> 00:06:30.366
Moria’s a Sky Trainer and she's also an instructor.

106
00:06:30.433 --> 00:06:33.033
-We got to see your Sky Battle earlier.

107
00:06:33.099 --> 00:06:34.599
You were watching?

108
00:06:34.666 --> 00:06:39.033
My opponent wasn’t much of a challenge, so I’m looking for someone new.

109
00:06:39.099 --> 00:06:41.799
Are Fletchling and Hawlucha your Pokémon?

110
00:06:41.866 --> 00:06:42.933
Yup.

111
00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.266
- Want to battle?
- I’d love to. I’m ready to go.

112
00:06:46.333 --> 00:06:49.666
But don’t forget that you’re just starting out.

113
00:06:49.733 --> 00:06:53.033
- You sure of this?
- He’ll be fine. I’ll be right there.

114
00:06:53.099 --> 00:06:54.266
- Right?
- You bet.

115
00:06:54.333 --> 00:06:57.700
Okay, I think I’ll battle with Fletchling.

116
00:06:57.766 --> 00:06:59.000
Fletch. Fletch.

117
00:06:59.066 --> 00:07:02.066
And, my Pokémon will be... hm!

118
00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:09.333
That’s the Pokémon from before.

119
00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.866
Talonflame, the Scorching Pokémon,

120
00:07:11.933 --> 00:07:14.233
and the final evolved form of Fletchling.

121
00:07:14.299 --> 00:07:17.299
Talonflame can swoop at incredible speeds when attacking.

122
00:07:17.366 --> 00:07:21.200
During intense battles, its wings give off showers of embers as it flies.

123
00:07:21.266 --> 00:07:24.333
- Wow.
- Fletch!

124
00:07:26.599 --> 00:07:28.766
Talonflame? You’re battling Fletchling.

125
00:07:28.833 --> 00:07:33.833
Fletch! Fletch! Fletch!

126
00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.833
Uh, I don’t think it’s interested.

127
00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:38.000
Fletch!

128
00:07:38.066 --> 00:07:40.533
But what about Hawlucha?

129
00:07:42.066 --> 00:07:45.400
Talonflame will agree to a battle with Hawlucha.

130
00:07:45.466 --> 00:07:46.733
Hawlucha! La!

131
00:07:46.799 --> 00:07:48.799
Fletch! Fletchling!

132
00:07:48.866 --> 00:07:52.533
But look. Fletchling really wants to battle.

133
00:07:52.599 --> 00:07:53.966
Oh, no.

134
00:07:54.033 --> 00:07:59.700
I’ve got an idea. If Hawlucha wins, then we’ll have a battle Fletchling.

135
00:07:59.766 --> 00:08:01.099
What do you say?

136
00:08:01.166 --> 00:08:04.500
- We’re definitely going to win.
- Chaluha!

137
00:08:04.566 --> 00:08:06.066
Fletchling.

138
00:08:06.133 --> 00:08:07.633
- Hey, Ash?
- Huh?

139
00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.366
I’ll look after Fletchling. Don’t worry.

140
00:08:10.433 --> 00:08:14.633
- Sounds great. It’s a deal.
- Oh. Come here.

141
00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:19.866
- Okay, Hawlucha. Let’s move!
- Hawlucha!

142
00:08:25.599 --> 00:08:27.900
- Whoa!
- Amazing.

143
00:08:32.466 --> 00:08:35.933
Go, Hawlucha!

144
00:08:37.966 --> 00:08:41.400
- Oh. Hey, cheer up, Fletchling.
- Na-na-na.

145
00:08:41.466 --> 00:08:44.066
That Talonflame doesn’t know how good you are.

146
00:08:44.133 --> 00:08:48.400
Just because you’re not big. You’ll prove it wrong after Hawlucha wins.

147
00:08:48.466 --> 00:08:50.766
- Fletchling.
- Being small’s okay.

148
00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:53.133
- Chling, Chling.
- I’m small too.

149
00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:56.699
I just wish people would stop judging us, because we’re small.

150
00:08:56.766 --> 00:09:00.600
Don’t forget. There’s a lot only we can do ‘cause we’re small.

151
00:09:00.666 --> 00:09:01.699
Fletchling!

152
00:09:01.766 --> 00:09:05.933
- Well, then, I’ll be the referee.
- Awesome. Thanks.

153
00:09:09.633 --> 00:09:11.500
All right, battle begin!

154
00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:21.266
- Talonflame, use Peck.
- Talonflame!

155
00:09:21.333 --> 00:09:22.566
Dodge it!

156
00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:28.199
- Use Flying Press.
- Haw!

157
00:09:28.266 --> 00:09:32.000
Since those Pokémon are both flying, it’s hard to land a move.

158
00:09:32.066 --> 00:09:34.333
You’re right.

159
00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.866
Talonflame, Steel Wing.

160
00:09:37.933 --> 00:09:42.466
Now use Brave Bird.

161
00:09:44.366 --> 00:09:48.033
Although Hawlucha’s a Flying type, it’s only able to glide.

162
00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.766
- That’s not good.
- Since it can’t really fly,

163
00:09:50.833 --> 00:09:55.933
- it’s a disadvantage.
- Hawlucha, aim and then use Karate Chop.

164
00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:59.933
Hawlucha!

165
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:04.333
I’ve got to draw them in so we can battle up close.

166
00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.600
- Pika. Pika
- Fletchling.

167
00:10:12.666 --> 00:10:16.766
- Fire Blast, go!
- Talonflame!

168
00:10:19.366 --> 00:10:25.033
Hawlucha. Grab onto Talonflame’s legs. Make it a close-quarters battle.

169
00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.933
That’s it.

170
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.133
Shake it off.

171
00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:38.033
- Oh! Hawlucha!
- Uh-oh.

172
00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:40.266
- Oh, no!
- Pika!

173
00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:45.300
Fletch! Ling!

174
00:10:45.366 --> 00:10:48.066
You okay?

175
00:10:48.133 --> 00:10:49.766
Then use Karate Chop!

176
00:10:49.833 --> 00:10:54.866
Steel Wing, go!

177
00:11:02.699 --> 00:11:08.233
Hawlucha is unable to battle, which means the winner is Talonflame.

178
00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:11.033
Hm.

179
00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:14.766
- Fletchling.
- Oh.

180
00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:19.733
- Ling!
- Fletchling, hm.

181
00:11:20.699 --> 00:11:23.233
- Guess I win.
- Yeah.

182
00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:26.433
But now what am I going to say to Fletchling?

183
00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.199
Good job. Hawlucha, return.

184
00:11:32.166 --> 00:11:35.833
- Moria? I have a favor.
- What’s that?

185
00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:39.333
Please battle Fletchling. It would mean a lot.

186
00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:44.100
Huh? But remember? I said we’d do that only if Hawlucha won.

187
00:11:44.166 --> 00:11:47.266
- Pretty please!
- That’d be really nice.

188
00:11:47.333 --> 00:11:49.300
Mm.

189
00:11:49.366 --> 00:11:53.866
- Talon! Talon! Talon!
- Huh?

190
00:11:53.933 --> 00:11:57.000
Hey. What’s going on?

191
00:11:57.066 --> 00:12:00.066
Who’s that Pokémon?

192
00:12:04.133 --> 00:12:06.600
It’s Talonflame.

193
00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:14.266
- Talonflame!
- Huh?

194
00:12:14.333 --> 00:12:16.300
Who are they? What are they doing?

195
00:12:16.366 --> 00:12:19.100
Prepare for trouble, aren’t we curious?

196
00:12:19.166 --> 00:12:21.300
Asking double questions could prove injurious.

197
00:12:21.366 --> 00:12:23.800
To protect the world from devastation.

198
00:12:23.866 --> 00:12:26.400
To unite all people within our nation.

199
00:12:26.466 --> 00:12:29.466
To denounce the evils of the friendly skies.

200
00:12:29.533 --> 00:12:33.000
To extend our reach to an unfriendly surprise.

201
00:12:33.066 --> 00:12:35.599
- Jessie.
- And James.

202
00:12:35.666 --> 00:12:38.466
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light.

203
00:12:38.533 --> 00:12:41.366
Surrender now or prepare for an airborne fight.

204
00:12:41.433 --> 00:12:42.933
Meowth, that’s right.

205
00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.000
Wobbuffet!

206
00:12:46.099 --> 00:12:47.833
- Team Rocket.
- Huh?

207
00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:51.033
They’re bad guys who like to steal other people’s Pokémon.

208
00:12:51.099 --> 00:12:53.566
If it’s all the same, we came for Talonflame.

209
00:12:53.633 --> 00:12:56.099
Give me back my Pokémon.

210
00:12:56.166 --> 00:12:58.766
-Come back. That’s not yours!

211
00:12:58.833 --> 00:13:00.300
You guys are through!

212
00:13:00.366 --> 00:13:03.133
Uh! Since when did they get flying clearance?

213
00:13:03.199 --> 00:13:04.566
No fair.

214
00:13:04.633 --> 00:13:06.300
We’re wearing wing suits.

215
00:13:06.366 --> 00:13:09.800
- I’d like to get my paws on a wing suit.
- I’d follow suit.

216
00:13:09.866 --> 00:13:11.800
Talonflame.

217
00:13:11.866 --> 00:13:15.133
Come out, Fennekin. Flamethrower.

218
00:13:15.199 --> 00:13:17.000
Flamethrower!

219
00:13:26.266 --> 00:13:29.533
-I told you you’re not getting away.

220
00:13:29.599 --> 00:13:31.699
Flying twerps are annoying twerps.

221
00:13:31.766 --> 00:13:36.233
- Show them a thing or two, Pumpkaboo.
- Go, Inkay too!

222
00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:38.966
- Pumpkaboo!
- Ink!

223
00:13:39.033 --> 00:13:41.533
- Fletch!
- Fletchling, want to help?

224
00:13:41.599 --> 00:13:44.366
Inkay. Use Tackle, go!

225
00:13:44.433 --> 00:13:48.000
- Okay, Fletchling, Razor Wind!
- Fletchling!

226
00:13:49.433 --> 00:13:52.366
- Use Steel Wing.
- Huh?

227
00:13:52.433 --> 00:13:54.366
It’s so quick.

228
00:13:54.433 --> 00:13:59.033
Unh! Pumpkaboo, Dark Pulse.

229
00:13:59.099 --> 00:14:03.733
- Dodge it and use Peck.
- Ling! Fletch!

230
00:14:04.866 --> 00:14:08.233
- Pumpkaboo.
- All right. Use Psybeam!

231
00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:11.000
Inkay!

232
00:14:11.066 --> 00:14:15.766
- Dodge and use Fire Blast.
- Fireblast!

233
00:14:17.099 --> 00:14:19.533
Big bang boom!

234
00:14:19.599 --> 00:14:21.900
Look, Ma. I’m flying.

235
00:14:21.966 --> 00:14:25.266
Yeah, but it’s got nothing to do with skills or talent.

236
00:14:25.333 --> 00:14:27.266
I want a wing suit.

237
00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:30.133
We’re blasting off again!

238
00:14:32.333 --> 00:14:34.933
That was close. Those guys are sneaky.

239
00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.433
- You’re right.
- Pikachu!

240
00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.199
- Ches!
- Na-na-na!

241
00:14:40.266 --> 00:14:42.733
- Fletch!
- Talonflame.

242
00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.633
- Flame Talon! Flame!
- Fletch!

243
00:14:45.699 --> 00:14:48.666
Talonflame, you want to battle Fletchling now?

244
00:14:48.733 --> 00:14:50.400
- Talon.
- Yeah, really?

245
00:14:50.466 --> 00:14:52.500
If that’s what Talonflame wants.

246
00:14:52.566 --> 00:14:56.066
- Would you two like to battle us?
- Would we?

247
00:14:56.133 --> 00:14:58.966
- Fletchling.
- You’ll be awesome.

248
00:14:59.033 --> 00:15:02.466
- Just show them your strength.
- Fletch. Fletch. Fletch!

249
00:15:06.966 --> 00:15:10.400
I know you can do it, Fletchling.

250
00:15:10.466 --> 00:15:13.066
All right then, battle begin!

251
00:15:13.133 --> 00:15:15.599
- Go.
- Go.

252
00:15:20.133 --> 00:15:24.433
Don’t forget. There’s a lot only we can do because we’re small.

253
00:15:28.833 --> 00:15:32.266
Fletch! Fletchling!

254
00:15:32.333 --> 00:15:34.866
Talonflame, use Steel Wing.

255
00:15:34.933 --> 00:15:37.599
Talonflame!

256
00:15:37.666 --> 00:15:39.500
Dodge it!

257
00:15:39.566 --> 00:15:41.900
Say, Fletchling’s fast. Use Peck!

258
00:15:41.966 --> 00:15:43.966
Talonflame!

259
00:15:44.033 --> 00:15:48.400
It’s easier to dodge 'cause you’re small.

260
00:15:48.466 --> 00:15:52.233
- Fire Blast, go!
- Talonflame!

261
00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:55.233
- Ling! Ling!
- Use Peck.

262
00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:58.466
Fletchling!

263
00:15:58.533 --> 00:16:00.833
Yay, Fletchling.

264
00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:04.099
- Keep it up. You can do it!
- That’s showing them.

265
00:16:04.166 --> 00:16:07.366
Great job. Keep giving it all you’ve got.

266
00:16:07.433 --> 00:16:10.366
- That’ll show them what you can do.
- Fletchling!

267
00:16:10.433 --> 00:16:14.866
- Talonflame, Brave Bird.
- Talon!

268
00:16:14.933 --> 00:16:19.400
- Dodge, Fletchling.
- All right, don’t let up.

269
00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:24.866
Fletch!

270
00:16:24.933 --> 00:16:28.066
Now you’re cornered. Use Steel Wing!

271
00:16:28.133 --> 00:16:32.199
- Dodge, then fly up!
- Fletchling!

272
00:16:32.266 --> 00:16:36.266
What do you know. That’s the real reason Fletchling flew down like that.

273
00:16:36.333 --> 00:16:39.333
It was pretending to be cornered, but that was just a lure.

274
00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:42.699
- What a maneuver.
- That was some strategy.

275
00:16:42.766 --> 00:16:45.699
Fletchling’s number one!

276
00:16:45.766 --> 00:16:49.033
All right, Brave Bird.

277
00:16:49.099 --> 00:16:52.666
- Quick, dodge it.
- Now, Fire Blast.

278
00:16:52.733 --> 00:16:53.900
Talon!

279
00:16:53.966 --> 00:16:57.333
- Double Team, go.
- Fletch! Fletch!

280
00:16:57.400 --> 00:16:59.933
Ugh, Fletchling knows Double Team, too?

281
00:17:02.133 --> 00:17:04.233
Fletchling!

282
00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:09.000
- Use Razor Wind.
- Fletch! Fletchling!

283
00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:12.866
-All right!

284
00:17:12.933 --> 00:17:15.533
Talonflame hesitated 'cause of the Double Team.

285
00:17:15.599 --> 00:17:18.099
- That’s when it attacked.
- Way to go, Fletchling.

286
00:17:18.166 --> 00:17:21.233
Playtime’s over, starting now. Use Steel Wing!

287
00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.599
Fletch!

288
00:17:24.666 --> 00:17:27.399
See? We both learned how Fletchling dodges.

289
00:17:27.466 --> 00:17:29.833
-Let’s finish this. Now, Fire Blast.

290
00:17:29.899 --> 00:17:32.833
- Talonflame!
- Fletchling!

291
00:17:36.399 --> 00:17:43.100
Fletch! Fletchling! Fletch! Fletchling!

292
00:17:44.133 --> 00:17:48.466
Fletch!

293
00:17:51.833 --> 00:17:53.066
- Now what?
- Huh?

294
00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:03.633
Fletchinder!

295
00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:05.633
- Awesome.
- Huh?

296
00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.333
Wow. It evolved.

297
00:18:07.399 --> 00:18:11.500
- Now it’s Fletchinder.
- What an amazing thing to watch.

298
00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.666
Fletchinder, the Ember Pokémon.

299
00:18:15.733 --> 00:18:20.133
Once in flight, Fletchinder can reach its top speed extremely quickly,

300
00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.733
giving it the edge in battle by attacking its opponents

301
00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.800
before they can get prepared.

302
00:18:24.866 --> 00:18:26.133
So cool.

303
00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:30.133
-It evolved into Fletchinder. Yay.

304
00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:34.133
Fletchinder!

305
00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.866
- Whoa. Is that--
- It’s Flame Charge.

306
00:18:36.933 --> 00:18:41.399
Wow! It learned a new move. All right. Use Flame Charge!

307
00:18:41.466 --> 00:18:42.866
Fletch!

308
00:18:42.933 --> 00:18:44.866
Dodge it.

309
00:18:44.933 --> 00:18:49.333
This is great. The more it uses Flame Charge, the faster it will become.

310
00:18:49.399 --> 00:18:51.433
- That’s amazing.
- Use Brave Bird.

311
00:18:53.033 --> 00:18:55.833
Dodge that then Flame Charge!

312
00:18:55.899 --> 00:19:01.066
Fletch! Fletchinder!

313
00:19:01.133 --> 00:19:02.566
That was close.

314
00:19:02.633 --> 00:19:05.566
Just a little more, Fletchinder!

315
00:19:05.633 --> 00:19:07.700
Keep it up. Flame Charge again!

316
00:19:07.766 --> 00:19:13.233
Fletchinder!

317
00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:16.966
Okay, let’s wrap it up. Flame Charge, go.

318
00:19:17.033 --> 00:19:21.899
Fletchinder!

319
00:19:23.466 --> 00:19:26.133
We did it.

320
00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:29.600
- Ha-ha!
- Wow, you won it, Fletchinder!

321
00:19:32.266 --> 00:19:35.766
Talonflame is unable to battle, which means Ash wins.

322
00:19:35.833 --> 00:19:37.633
Well, all right.

323
00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:42.133
Oh, dear. Guess we lost. You were great, Talonflame.

324
00:19:43.533 --> 00:19:46.133
Fletch! Fletchinder!

325
00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.866
You got me. Fletchinder was such a total surprise.

326
00:19:49.933 --> 00:19:50.933
Thanks.

327
00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.933
Fletchinder. You did it!

328
00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.700
I knew you’d win it. I believed in you!

329
00:19:55.766 --> 00:19:59.866
Fletchinder! Fletchinder!

330
00:19:59.933 --> 00:20:02.399
Hurray for Fletchinder!

331
00:20:09.166 --> 00:20:12.166
- Thanks so much for everything.
- Pikachu!

332
00:20:12.233 --> 00:20:15.000
- We had a great time.
- Hope to come back soon.

333
00:20:15.066 --> 00:20:19.399
And, Bonnie? Once you grow a little bit taller...

334
00:20:19.466 --> 00:20:22.000
- I can fly too.
- Na-na!

335
00:20:22.066 --> 00:20:26.166
- I’ll have your very own wing suit ready.
- Mm-hm. I can’t wait.

336
00:20:26.233 --> 00:20:28.000
Pikachu!

337
00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:35.233
In the midst of Ash’s first exhilarating Sky Battle,

338
00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:40.000
Fletchling evolved into Fletchinder, spurred on by Bonnie’s heartfelt support.

339
00:20:40.066 --> 00:20:44.233
Now, with blue skies and breath-taking landscapes on their minds,

340
00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:47.833
our heroes journey continues.
